{
  "key": "LAC-245",
  "url": "https://akumina.atlassian.net/browse/LAC-245",
  "summary": "Resource directory - card view has favorite star - Enable “Favorite” (star) functionality in Resource Directory list view",
  "descriptionText": "The Resource Directory currently supports a “Favorite” (star) feature in the card view, allowing users to mark items for quick access. This functionality is not available in the list view, creating an inconsistent user experience.\n\nRequest:\nImplement the same “Favorite” (star) functionality in the Resource Directory list view.\n\nExpected Behavior:\n\n- Users can mark/unmark items as favorites directly from the list view\n- Favorite state is consistent across both card and list views\n- Favorited items persist across sessions (if already supported in card view)\n\nCurrent Behavior:\n\n- Favorite (star) option is only available in card view\n- List view does not provide a way to favorite items\n\nBusiness Impact:\n\n- Improves usability and consistency across views\n- Enables users to manage favorites regardless of preferred view\n- Enhances overall user experience\n\nAcceptance Criteria:\n\n- Star icon is visible for each item in list view\n- Users can toggle favorite status from list view\n- Changes reflect immediately and sync with card view\n- Favorite state persists correctly\n- No regression in existing card view functionality",
  "status": "Backlog",
  "issueType": "Task",
  "priority": "High",
  "assignee": "Diego Rosa",
  "created": "2026-03-05T15:48:05.606-0500",
